# Offline oracle note — dfpt-gga-spin-smearing (PW DFPT joint spin × GGA × smear)

## Intent

Pin Γ-point DFPT phonons for diamond Si with the **three-way joint**
collinear-spin × pure-GGA × Fermi–Dirac metallic occupation smearing response
path (`nspin=2`, multiplicity=1, PBE, degauss=0.02 Ry) on the plane-wave
method — the product of shipped pairwise pins `dfpt-gga-spin-si`,
`dfpt-spin-smearing`, and `dfpt-gga-si`.

## Oracle status (2026-08-01) — CP2K RUN, offline

**CP2K 2026.1** (source rev `git:5e54ba2`, binary
`/nobackup/proj/disk/teoroo/personal/jicli594/work/cp2k/install/bin/cp2k.psmp`,
env `…/install/env.sh`, Arrhenius epyc login). CP2K has no PW-DFPT, so the
twin is `RUN_TYPE VIBRATIONAL_ANALYSIS` — FD of analytic UKS **k-point**
forces on the same spin×GGA×smear Hamiltonian class:

- Input: `inputs/dfpt-gga-spin-smearing/si2_uks_pbe_smear_vib.inp`
  (LSD, MULTIPLICITY 1, PBE, FERMI_DIRAC ELECTRONIC_TEMPERATURE 3157.75 K
  ≡ degauss 0.02 Ry, ADDED_MOS 4, DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH, GTH-PBE-q4, CUTOFF 300
  Ry, MP 2×2×2, `FULLY_PERIODIC T`, DX 0.01 bohr, `EPS_SCF 1e-8`).
- Run:
  ```bash
  source /nobackup/proj/disk/teoroo/personal/jicli594/work/cp2k/install/env.sh
  export OMP_NUM_THREADS=1
  cd /tmp/work && ln -sf $CP2K_DATA_DIR/{BASIS_MOLOPT,GTH_POTENTIALS} .
  mpirun -np 1 cp2k.psmp -i si2_uks_pbe_smear_vib.inp -o out
  ```
- Output line:
  `VIB|Frequency (cm^-1)   463.983524           534.803847           534.803847`
  → optical Γ modes **463.98, 534.80, 534.80 cm⁻¹** (mean 511.2).
- Wall (serial, 1 MPI × OMP=1): **232.5 s**. ATV DFPT twin regression:
  **48.3 s** → fair ratio r = T_atv/T_cp2k = **0.21** (≤ 10).

The GPW GTH/MOLOPT representation differs from the ATV NC-UPF 10 Ry PW twin,
so the CP2K number anchors the **physics window** ([450, 650] cm⁻¹), not the
digit. The sharp same-Hamiltonian gate is below.

## Sharp pin (same Hamiltonian, free-energy path)

Central second difference of the **collinear-spin PBE free energy** under
Fermi–Dirac smear (h = 0.03 Å on atom-0 x, SCF tol 1e-9, identical
ecut/k/XC/UPF/spin/FD): C[(0x),(0x)] = (F⁺ − 2F⁰ + F⁻)/h² · 27.211386245988
= **17.3454 eV/Å²** (F⁰ = −7.820593875040 Ha, F± = −7.820306828150 /
−7.820307232893 Ha; gapped fill ⇒ \|TS\| ~ 1e-15 Ry, F=E; this host,
2026-08-01, Release, OMP=1). Recorded with the DFPT gates in
`regressions/response/dfpt-gga-spin-smearing/REFERENCE.md`.

## Twin settings (match regression)

| Item | Value |
| ---- | ----- |
| Cell | diamond Si, a = 5.43 Å, 2-atom fcc primitive |
| PP | `tests/data/pw/Si_lda_nc.upf` (in-tree NC ONCV) |
| XC | PBE (pure GGA; joint spin kernel via FD of the spin-GGA XC operator) |
| Spin | collinear, multiplicity = 1 (M = 0) |
| Smear | Fermi–Dirac, degauss = 0.02 Ry, extra_bands = 0 |
| ecut | 10 Ry |
| k-mesh | 2×2×2 MP |
